---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
flowchart TD
    Start([vigilo coordinator start])

    CoordinatorId[Generate coordinator id]
    Runner[Start coordinator service runner]
    Event{Next service event?}
    Contexts{Runtime contexts available?}
    Dispatch[Drain dispatchable run windows]
    Finalize[Drain finalizable runs]
    Outbox[Publish pending outbox events]
    Wait[Wait for next tick]
    Shutdown[Cancel service loop]
    Stop{Service stopped in time?}

    Success([Success response])

    ContextFail([Runtime context error])
    CycleFail([Coordinator cycle error])
    ShutdownFail([Shutdown error])

    Start --> CoordinatorId
    CoordinatorId --> Runner
    Runner --> Event

    Event -- Tick elapsed --> Contexts
    Event -- Shutdown signal --> Shutdown

    Contexts -- No --> ContextFail
    Contexts -- Yes --> Dispatch

    Dispatch --> Finalize
    Dispatch -. Dispatch fails .-> CycleFail

    Finalize --> Outbox
    Finalize -. Finalization fails .-> CycleFail

    Outbox --> Wait
    Outbox -. Publish pass fails .-> CycleFail

    Wait --> Event

    Shutdown --> Stop
    Shutdown -. Shutdown hook fails .-> ShutdownFail

    Stop -- Yes --> Success
    Stop -- No --> ShutdownFail

    class Start command
    class Success success
    class CoordinatorId,Runner,Event,Contexts,Dispatch,Finalize,Outbox,Wait,Shutdown,Stop system
    class ContextFail,CycleFail,ShutdownFail error
